WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:12.000
Hi, I am Dr. Aditya Soni, ek psychiatrist. Kya aap lagataar overthinking, anxiety, intrusive thoughts, low mood, OCD symptoms ya sleep problems feel kar rahe hain?

00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:19.000
Kya aapka dimaag continuously sochta rehta hai? Agar aisa kuch hai, to you should seek some help.

00:00:19.000 --> 00:00:23.000
That’s why maine ek simple Mental Health Screening Questionnaire banaya hai.

00:00:23.000 --> 00:00:31.000
Ek questionnaire hai, jo mere link in bio me diya hua hai. Isko answer karke aap apni Mental Health ke baare me pehchaan sakte hain.

00:00:31.000 --> 00:00:47.000
Yeh ek diagnostic questionnaire nahi hai. Yeh aapko kisi bimari ka diagnosis nahi batayega, but yeh indicate kar dega ki yeh simply aapki life ka normal pattern hai ya aapko koi professional help ki zarurat hai.

00:00:47.000 --> 00:01:17.000
Yeh quiz sirf aapko guide karne ke liye ek first step hai. Iska koi diagnostic purpose nahi hai. Agar quiz ke end me yeh suggest kare ki aapko professional help ki requirement hai,

00:01:17.000 --> 00:01:17.120
tab please professional guidance lene ke baare me zarur sochein.
